{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"TAO","id":"267178019196633099","is_bot":0,"username":"dm_tao"},"author_id":"267178019196633099","channel_id":"852737863170654259","content":"Over the next few numbers, Cairn gets a better feel for the new instrument and experiments with various imagery. A band of mustangs galloping over the windswept moors. A wedding party with the most decadent adornments and a lavish feast. An orphan boy crying in his blistered hands in a back alley of the worn cobblestone streets of Glasgow.","created_at":"2021-07-12T20:22:51.054000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864240412097249310","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"TAO","id":"267178019196633099","is_bot":0,"username":"dm_tao"},"author_id":"267178019196633099","channel_id":"852737863170654259","content":"The pipes, proving to be rather magnificent, have Cairn so wrapped up in the performance that he continues to play as if the festival around them and the gathering crowd has drifted away entirely.","created_at":"2021-07-12T21:23:39.080000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864255713027424317","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
